                                    Lulusar Lake is nestled in the Kaghan Valley, surrounded by
                                    snow-capped mountains. The road to this magnificent place is
                                    in fine shape. Moreover, this gigantic Lake's journey provides
                                    some spectacular vistas along the route, passing by some
                                    beautiful waterfalls and across some glacier-fed streams.
                                    Animals such as foxes, black bears, Himalayan snow cock,
                                    marmots, and hawks can be observed because the Lake resides at
                                    the Lulusar Dudipatsar national park. Tourists can also
                                    experience hiking and camping at the Lake.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="row agent-2 a-three g-0 clearfix">
                    <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12">
