                            <h4>Ansoo Lake</h4>

                            <div class="contact">
                                <p>
                                    Ansoo Lake, at an elevation of 4,250 meters, is a great
                                    treasure high in the Himalayas. A trekking journey is required
                                    to reach this hidden beauty of nature. First, a traveler must
                                    take a jeep ride to Saif ul Malook Lake, followed by two hours
                                    of horse riding in the upper Himalayan region. After that,
                                    it's a one-hour hike to Lake Ansoo. June to August is the best
                                    season to explore as the area receives considerable snowfall
                                    during the other months, which might be risky for hikers.
                                </p>
                            </div>
