                                    Dudipatsar Lake is known as Crown Lake in Pakistan for its
                                    spectacular beauty. Tourists can reach by driving until
                                    Jalkhand in the Naran Valley. After the drive, the traveler
                                    can enjoy a 4-5 hour hike with amazing views. The most
                                    incredible time to view this treasure trove of nature is from
                                    June to August. Furthermore, significant snowfall falls on the
                                    area, causing concern for visitors who may become trapped.
                                </p>
